  {
   "uuid": "cd8087dc-4107-4419-9191-e1b873beef67",
   "component_id": "sdc.meridian.card",
   "parent_uuid": "4ba79092-fd2e-40bc-991e-0a255ea00805",
   "slot": "parts",
   "inputs": {
    "tag": "div",
    "heading": "Gate",
    "heading_level": "h3",
    "padded": true
   }
  },
  {
   "uuid": "4eeabc0d-15bf-4570-b390-17be39f00ba4",
   "component_id": "sdc.meridian.paragraph",
   "parent_uuid": "cd8087dc-4107-4419-9191-e1b873beef67",
   "slot": "parts",
   "inputs": {
    "body": "Your gate number appears 60 minutes before departure. Until then the gate tiles are blank, and the Info column tells you when to look again, for example \"Gate at 10:10\". Gates 1 to 19 are in Terminal 1 and gates 20 to 38 are in Terminal 2.",
    "variant": "card-text"
   }
  },
  {
   "uuid": "aaf861a8-3b5a-4bb2-b18b-ae2f42dedf76",
   "component_id": "sdc.meridian.card",
   "parent_uuid": "4ba79092-fd2e-40bc-991e-0a255ea00805",
   "slot": "parts",
   "inputs": {
    "tag": "div",
    "heading": "Belt",
    "heading_level": "h3",
    "padded": true
   }
  },
  {
   "uuid": "bbdec675-2209-408e-9f0b-165e1baadfea",
   "component_id": "sdc.meridian.paragraph",
   "parent_uuid": "aaf861a8-3b5a-4bb2-b18b-ae2f42dedf76",
   "slot": "parts",
   "inputs": {
    "body": "Once a flight has landed, the Belt column shows the reclaim belt for its bags, for example 3. Belts 1 to 4 are in Terminal 1 and belts 5 to 8 are in Terminal 2. The Info column tells you which arrivals exit to wait at: Arrivals A in Terminal 1, Arrivals B in Terminal 2.",
    "variant": "card-text"
   }
  },
  {
   "uuid": "5dad9ebc-a1dd-4713-a5a7-b7042a1d5f9f",
   "component_id": "sdc.meridian.card",
   "parent_uuid": "4ba79092-fd2e-40bc-991e-0a255ea00805",
   "slot": "parts",
   "inputs": {
    "tag": "div",
    "heading": "Info",
    "heading_level": "h3",
    "padded": true
   }
  },
  {
   "uuid": "b9f6bcdd-2eb5-4b4b-b5c0-f516920b1969",
   "component_id": "sdc.meridian.paragraph",
   "parent_uuid": "5dad9ebc-a1dd-4713-a5a7-b7042a1d5f9f",
   "slot": "parts",
   "inputs": {
    "body": "The Info column tells you what to do next. For example:",
    "variant": "card-text"
   }
  },
  {
   "uuid": "5d49b658-923a-4696-998f-edbed8bb0e87",
   "component_id": "sdc.meridian.prose",
   "parent_uuid": "5dad9ebc-a1dd-4713-a5a7-b7042a1d5f9f",
   "slot": "parts",
   "inputs": {
    "body": "<ul>\n<li>Closes 10:20: the gate closes at this time. Be there before it.</li>\n<li>New time 10:58 · fog: the flight is delayed to the new time, and why.</li>\n<li>Gate at 10:10: the gate will show at this time.</li>\n<li>Rebook at desk 14 or in app: the flight is cancelled. Your airline will rebook you at that desk or in its app.</li>\n<li>Exit: Arrivals A: meet your passenger at this exit.</li>\n<li>Expected 10:40: the delayed flight is now due at this time.</li>\n</ul>"
   }
  },
  {
   "uuid": "26f81e95-3edd-4bae-be4a-b42115a1ba4e",
   "component_id": "sdc.meridian.section",
   "inputs": {
    "anchor": "status-meaning",
